 iors must fight their way from the Bronx to their home turf on Coney Islan
 d when they are falsely accused of assassinating a respected gang leader. 
 Often Compared to Homer's Odyssey\, The Warriors is actually a retelling o
 f Xenophon's ancient Greek text Anabasis. Michael Beck\, James Remar\, Tho
 mas Waites\, Deborah V\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com
