 ? Screen printing is a fun and easy way to customize items like a poster\,
  or in this program a fabric item like a tote bag. Ink is pushed through a
  mesh screen onto a surface using methods like a stencil to create a desig
 n. If you take a look around\, I bet you own at least one item like a t-sh
 irt that has been made using screen printing. Alex will show you the basic
  skills for screen printing and you will be able to make a custom tote bag
 . After learning\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/event
 s/6ae0bc28de300e00451d15dc
LOCATION:West Lawn\, 4020 W. 63rd St.\, Chicago\, IL 60636
URL:https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/events/6ae0bc28de300e00451d15dc
